.TH SDL_HasSVE2 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HasSVE2 \- Determine whether the CPU has SVE2 (Scalable Vector Extension 2).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_cpuinfo.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_HasSVE2(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is only relevant on ARM64 Linux\[char46] On other platforms it always returns false\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if the CPU has SVE2, false otherwise\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

